#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9711 expect=skipped domain=DM
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9711 — the Required key USUBJID is not populated.
#note "USUBJID is absent from DM, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(USUBJID) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col SUBJID type=Char
col SITEID type=Char
---
S1      | DM     | 001    | 01
---
